1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,324
A kraken big enough to grab

2
00:00:01,324 --> 00:00:02,415
a ship would be a hundred

3
00:00:02,415 --> 00:00:03,947
times heavier than the biggest squid

4
00:00:03,947 --> 00:00:04,817
ever found.

5
00:00:05,248 --> 00:00:06,908
And muscle that heavy sinks like

6
00:00:06,908 --> 00:00:07,650
a stone.

7
00:00:08,162 --> 00:00:09,334
So you fill your body with

8
00:00:09,334 --> 00:00:10,054
ammonia,

9
00:00:10,054 --> 00:00:11,388
like a giant squid.

10
00:00:11,819 --> 00:00:13,316
It's lighter than seawater,

11
00:00:13,329 --> 00:00:14,779
so you float for free.

12
00:00:15,535 --> 00:00:16,939
But a body this big burns

13
00:00:16,939 --> 00:00:17,949
through oxygen,

14
00:00:17,949 --> 00:00:19,366
and squid blood is terrible at

15
00:00:19,366 --> 00:00:20,166
carrying it.

16
00:00:20,376 --> 00:00:21,466
So you live deep.

17
00:00:21,734 --> 00:00:23,569
Cold water holds more oxygen,

18
00:00:23,569 --> 00:00:24,730
and your blood works better in

19
00:00:24,730 --> 00:00:25,425
the cold.

20
00:00:25,937 --> 00:00:26,889
But down there,

21
00:00:26,889 --> 00:00:27,979
it's pitch black.

22
00:00:28,607 --> 00:00:29,989
So you grow eyes the size

23
00:00:29,989 --> 00:00:30,917
of dinner plates,

24
00:00:30,929 --> 00:00:32,426
like the colossal squid.

25
00:00:32,938 --> 00:00:34,295
The biggest eyes on Earth.

26
00:00:34,807 --> 00:00:36,490
But something down there hunts you:

27
00:00:37,001 --> 00:00:37,999
sperm whales.

28
00:00:38,754 --> 00:00:40,124
So your giant eyes watch for

29
00:00:40,124 --> 00:00:41,669
the glow a diving whale stirs

30
00:00:41,669 --> 00:00:42,109
up,

31
00:00:42,121 --> 00:00:43,456
from more than a hundred meters

32
00:00:43,456 --> 00:00:44,129
away.

33
00:00:44,640 --> 00:00:45,848
That's why nobody ever sees a

34
00:00:45,848 --> 00:00:46,509
kraken.

35
00:00:46,939 --> 00:00:48,575
It isn't hiding from sailors.

36
00:00:49,006 --> 00:00:50,352
In the warm water up here,

37
00:00:50,399 --> 00:00:51,559
it can't breathe.

